      "step": 1,
      "title": "Undo the affine spectrum and keep all normalizations nonzero",
      "text": "Write the eigenvalue as alpha plus beta times the cosine. Kappa at least2 makes beta nonzero. The source dimension gives a nonzero square-root scale, while the constant and positive-frequency columns have nonzero factors1 and sqrt2. These facts are proved inside the theorem.",
